' Sibling-dedup regression: the middle object (stands in for the SD driver).
' Declares the leaf and carries NO debug() of its own, so every record in its
' cached subtree belongs to the leaf -- which is what makes a dropped record
' unambiguous rather than merged with the parent's own.
OBJ
  leaf : "sibrec_leaf"

PUB run(value)
  leaf.probe(value)
